          "body": "Japan's federation has suspended Eddie Jones for four games and cut his salary over \"verbal abuse directed at local officials\" during the Under-23 tour of Australia in April. The ban rules him out of the Nations Championship opener against Italy and the Japan XV game against the Maori All Blacks. Jones has accepted the sanction, saying: \"I deeply regret my behaviour and words.\" The Japan Rugby Football Union announced the penalty in May."
