          "heading": "Hansen praises All Blacks' running lines and handling in Bledisloe win",
          "body": "Sir Steve Hansen believes the All Blacks are finally being rewarded for Dave Rennie's attacking work, calling their running lines \"sublime\" in Saturday's 43-21 win over Australia in Sydney. Speaking on the Rugby Unity podcast, he singled out big forwards taking short and long balls into space, Codie Taylor's handling under pressure and Cam Roigard's willingness to pass in the tackle. The win sealed a 2-0 Bledisloe series after the 50-19 win at Eden Park."
