          "body": "Wales have taken a page from Rassie Erasmus' playbook, with the WRU naming referee Ben Whitehouse a full-time specialist coach for the men's squad to work on law, discipline, decision-making and communication. It mirrors the role Jaco Peyper has filled with the Springboks since 2024, when he joined the Springbok management as national laws advisor. Whitehouse, 36, is set to hang up his whistle after Saturday's URC clash between the Ospreys and Dragons."
